QA4 pre-existing 1. A wrapper is written after it was built, through a pointer
to it: a store through the target that errors.As filled. The wrapper is
returned: its Wrap holds, besides what the literal stored, what the later
writers of the field store, flagged as location values. (Run time has the
later value only; errtrace does not order the stores.)
